<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1.tThe results have been prepared in accordance with the Indian Accounting Standards (Ind AS) notified under the Companies (Ind AS) Rules, 2015 and   nsubsequent amendments.  n2.tAs the Company's business activity falls within a single primary business segment, the disclosure requirements of  Accounting Standard (Ind AS-108)   n  Operating Segments  , are not applicable.   nt3.tSince the Company's business relates to Micronutrient Fertilizers, Plant Nutrient Solutions etc. the same is impacted by cropping pattern, seasonality and  nErratic weather conditions across the Globe in general and India in particular. Accordingly, quarterly figures are not representative of the full year's   nperformance.  nt4.tThe above Financial  Results were reviewed and recommended by the Audit Committee and there upon approved by  the Board of  Directors at their   nrespective meetings held on 11th February, 2020.  nt5.tThe Statutory Auditors have carried out a Limited Review of the Results for the Quarter ended 31st December, 2019.  nt6.tThe Un-Audited Standalone / Consolidated financial results are for the Quarter ended 31st December, 2019.  nt7.tThe Consolidated Un-Audited Financial Results have been prepared in accordance with Ind AS 110  Consolidated Financial Statements .   n8.tAs there are no sales in overseas entities during the quarter ended 31st December, 2019, the Revenue from Operations of both, Standalone and Consolidated   nremains the same.  n9.tAs approved by the Board in their Meeting held on 13th November, 2019 and intimated to the Stock Exchanges on the same day, a Wholly Owned  nSubsidiary named “MIRABELLE AGRO MANUFACTURING PRIVATE LIMITED” has been incorporated on 26th December, 2019.  nt10.tPrevious Period's / Year's figures   have  been   re-grouped  /  re-arranged  wherever necessary  to correspond with the Current Period's figures.   nt11.tThe above results will be made available at the Company's Website at www.ariesagro.com on or after 12th February, 2020.</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
